## Quick Answer

Max Q first, followed by E and W. Run Lethal Tempo with Precision primary and Resolve secondary. Start Doran's Blade and build Blade of the Ruined King, Immortal Shieldbow, and Infinity Edge.

Play around your passive shield, prepare tornadoes before trading, and use minions as entry and escape routes. Save Wind Wall for important projectiles and avoid using Last Breath on every airborne target if the landing position is dangerous.

